From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Georg Lehmann <dadschoorse@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 14:29:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] aco: avoid mubuf bounds checking for global

MUBUF access with 32bit offset is bounds checked.
We tried to handle this for offset + const_offset overflows,
but failed to account for the payload size.

